      en: ["The winery was founded in 1827 by a decree of Tsar Nicholas I.", "Negru de Purcari won a gold medal at the Paris World Expo in 1878.", "The estate manages over 250 hectares of specialized vineyards.", "The historical cellars were constructed in 1827 and remain functional.", "The castle is situated approximately 120 kilometers from Chișinău.", "Purcari wines are currently exported to more than 30 countries globally."],
