      en: ["The stone fortress was reconstructed in 1538 by Suleiman the Magnificent.", "The entire fortification complex spans an area of 20 hectares.", "King Charles XII of Sweden sought refuge here from 1709 to 1713.", "The defensive structure features 10 bastions and 11 distinct gates.", "The fortress came under definitive Russian control in the year 1812.", "A significant restoration project for the site was initiated in 2008."],
