      en: ["The City Hall was officially inaugurated in 1901.", "The design was a collaboration between Alexander Bernardazzi and Mitrofan Elladi.", "The building was completely reconstructed in 1948 following WWII damage.", "Its facade design incorporates Italian Neo-Gothic and Renaissance elements.", "The tower clock strikes every hour and serves as a major city symbol.", "The building is located on Ștefan cel Mare Boulevard, the city's main street."],
