      en: ["Founded on August 22, 1832, following the initiative of the local government.", "The current neoclassical building was opened in 1961 and is a protected monument.", "The library holds more than 5 million items, including books, maps, and recordings.", "It houses the most valuable collection of rare and old books in the country.", "The institution is a key organizer of the International Book Fair in Chisinau.", "The library leads the 'Moldavica' project for the digitalization of national heritage."],
